1. Private room with its own separate entrance, private bathroom;
2. Quiet and convenient location, 8 minutes walking to the Burqutilam Skytrain Station, 2 minutes to the bus stop;
3. Free wifi, on site laundary;
4. Perfect for single perfessionals, or university students;
5. Friendly and easy-going family.

Available Dec 1st, 2026

For viewing, please Email or call  show contact info
 us and we will get back to you.

•	In New Westminster most sought after Up-Town area near 6th Ave and 6th Street;
•	In a quiet cul de sac of Ash Street next to New Westminster Public Library;
•	Steps away from Royal City Shopping Center, London Drug, Save On Food, Wal-Mart, banks, and restaurants;
•	Close to Moody parks, schools, public transit, Douglas College, and Sky Train;
•	Buses on both 8th Street and 6th Ave are just a couple minutes away;
•	Well maintained, quiet and clean adult oriented building;
•	Bright and clean common coin laundry facility on site;
•	Large 1 bedroom corner suite on the 3rd  floor of a 3 storey building with elevator;
•	About 450 sft of space with large balcony and lots of natural light;
•	New laminate floor, new paint, new bathroom sink;
•	New tile floor in kitchen, new cabinet paint, new fridge and new stove;
•	Rent $1395 per month including heat and hot water;
•	Underground parking available at $40 per month;
•	Work and tenancy references are required;
•	1 cat is allowed with ½ month rent pet damage deposit;
•	Most suitable for single or couple;
•	Pet damage deposit and security deposit payable at signing tenancy agreement;
•	An initial fixed term of 6 months renewable for another 6 or 12 months;
•	No waterbed, no aquarium, no barbecue, no dogs and no smoking of any kind including Marijuana;
•	All applications are subject to employment and tenancy reference and checks;
•	Available now.

For faster response, please introduce yourselves by responding to the questions below:

•	What is your full legal name?
•	What do you do for a living?
•	Do you have pets and smoke?
•	Can you pay rent by post dated checks or e-transfer?
•	When will you be available to view the suite?
•	When would you like to move in?
•	How many persons are renting the suite?
